  "prefLabel": "Pes 305.05 Procedures for Examination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 305.05 Procedures for Examination.\n\n(a) Applicants, after submitting an exam application provided by the division as described under Pes 304.07(e), shall be notified, through the division of pesticide control, their local cooperative extension spokesperson, or both as to the time and place of examination.\n\n(b) Examination shall be given only by appointment through the division.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74; amd by #1410.1, eff 8-1-79; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4687, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
